<title>UK: Wimpey sells properties for 30 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Wimpey sells properties for 30 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction group George Wimpey Plc said on Monday it had sold part of its property portfolio for around 30 million stg.</p>
<p>Wimpey said the properties included commercial office and warehouse space. The company said the revenue generated was in line with its expectations and that it was on track to meet its disposals target for this year. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
